{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚電視大戰正式展開，HOY推出由李尚正主演處境劇《你的保安李寶安》硬撼友台8點黃金時段。劇集首播同時於官方YouTube頻道一口氣上架首4集，迅速累積突破100萬觀看次數，劇組在排陣與對白設計上精心計算，背後原來隱藏一場激烈的收視爭奪戰！\n</p>\n<h2>李尚正新劇連播四集搶攻網絡平台</h2>\n<p>由李尚正飾演保安主任李寶安聯同盧頌恩（妹頭）及麥沛東等人主演處境劇首播。故事以高級屋苑臨海峯作為背景，講述一班保安員日常經歷。電視台為搶奪網絡流量，破格將首4集同步上載至YouTube頻道。全數4集點擊率表現強勢，第一集錄得48.1萬次觀看，第二至第四集分別獲得24.1萬、15.1萬及13.7萬次觀賞，合共錄得101萬次總觀看次數，成功突破100萬大關。</p>\n<h2>電視台出招提早完場迎戰八點檔收視</h2>\n<p>面對友台8點黃金時段收視回升壓力，電視台高層採取靈活應對策略。製作團隊明顯將重點放在網絡平台點擊率，同時在電視播映時間上作出特別安插。網民更留意到：「其實HoyTV做得好好，李寶安做到8:25就完咗，俾咗5分鐘時間觀眾可以選擇去睇《愛回家》」。</p>\n<h2>狂加爆笑金句＋網絡迷因引熱議</h2>\n<p>劇本編寫大量加入時下流行元素與搞笑對白，角色設定充滿話題性。劇中保安員在自我介紹環節大玩同音字食字梗，盧頌恩飾演角色畢好彩指自己哥哥名為畢𤒹生，借機幽默提及人氣男團副隊長江𤒹生名字讀音爭議。另外亦加入「柳暗花明又一村，古天樂女朋友都變宣萱」等押韻句式。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚：正爺同麥東個節奏真係正</h2>\n<p>觀眾對這部處境劇評價呈現兩極。有網民留言大讚「正爺同麥東個節奏真係正」，不過亦有部分觀眾提出改善建議，指出「節奏太慢，燈光太暗」，認為劇本過度依賴網絡迷因反而拖慢整體敘事節奏，喜劇效果尚未能令大眾自然發笑：「第二集好咗啲，但gag位真係唔駛塞咁滿」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931120578375653_19067540486ae0b7fa2e12d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931120578375653_19067540486ae0b7fa2e12d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>四集加起來的總觀看次數為101萬次，已經超過了一百萬。（圖片來源：HOY YouTube）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311205932031022_14362856536ae0b7fbb021e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311205932031022_14362856536ae0b7fbb021e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>劇本編寫大量加入時下流行元素與搞笑對白，角色設定充滿話題性。（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206147893924_9187810626ae0b7fdc2eb5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206147893924_9187810626ae0b7fdc2eb5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>第二集妹頭寫真成重點！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206321551727_10202228306ae0b7ff8633b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206321551727_10202228306ae0b7ff8633b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>有網民留言大讚「正爺同麥東個節奏真係正」！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206484741369_10363850996ae0b80124ca5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311206484741369_10363850996ae0b80124ca5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T15:01:12.057865+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1106,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T14:41:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:12:20.035038+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T14:58:34.497343+00:00","content_hash":"7a0bdefcb5193b4b75dabc9dbb4f307fa54b675ff927b98fc20f6a59dfa502c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}